{"title": "Whispering Mask", "pageid": 3950, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Whispering_Mask", "categories": ["Helmets", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Whispering_Mask_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Whispering_Mask_Icon.png/300px-Whispering_Mask_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/a/a3/Whispering_Mask_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Whispering Mask image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Whispering_Mask_Icon.png/300px-Whispering_Mask_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Whispering_Mask_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Whispering Mask</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmet</a> with connections to <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie Ethel</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Soft, unintelligible whispers seep from the dark wood, ringing in your ears and resounding in your skull.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" title=\"Helmets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/38px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/50px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helmets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png/25px-Helmets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/99/Helmets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helmets\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Helmets\">Helmets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">DEC_HAG_Mask_A</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DEC_HAG_Mask_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:DEC_HAG_Mask_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">73690248-deea-4713-84d6-c1c8fb045869</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:73690248-deea-4713-84d6-c1c8fb045869\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:73690248-deea-4713-84d6-c1c8fb045869\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ACT1_HAG_HagMask</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ACT1_HAG_HagMask+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ACT1_HAG_HagMask+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>File</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Headwear_Hag_Mask</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>If Ethel is dead: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uncanny_Sight_(Condition)\" title=\"Uncanny Sight (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Uncanny Sight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Uncanny_Sight_(Condition)\" title=\"Uncanny Sight (Condition)\">Uncanny Sight</a></li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Part_of_the_Flock\" title=\"Part of the Flock\">Part of the Flock</a></dt><dd>Auntie Ethel welcomes you, dearie.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Uncanny_Sight\"> Condition: Uncanny Sight </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uncanny_Sight_(Condition)\" title=\"Uncanny Sight (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Uncanny Sight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Uncanny_Sight_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Uncanny_Sight_(Condition)\" title=\"Uncanny Sight (Condition)\">Uncanny Sight</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can see objects hidden to the unaided eye.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Riverside_Teahouse\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Riverside Teahouse\">Riverside Teahouse</a>: 4x – on a table in the <a href=\"/wiki/Overgrown_Tunnel#Entrance_Gallery\" title=\"Overgrown Tunnel\">Overgrown Tunnel Entrance Gallery</a>, just before the Gnarled Door</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Riverside_Teahouse\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Riverside Teahouse\">Riverside Teahouse</a>: Worn by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Vengeance_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Vengeance (Overgrown Tunnel)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/38px-Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e3/Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/50px-Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mask of Vengeance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e3/Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e3/Portrait_Mask_of_Vengeance_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Vengeance_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Vengeance (Overgrown Tunnel)\">Mask of Vengeance</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Servitude_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Servitude (Overgrown Tunnel)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/38px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/50px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mask of Servitude\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Servitude_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Servitude (Overgrown Tunnel)\">Mask of Servitude</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Regret_(Overgrown_Tunnel)\" title=\"Mask of Regret (Overgrown Tunnel)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/38px-Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png/50px-Portrait_Mask_of_Regret_%28Overgrown_Tunnel%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mask of Regret\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Ma