k_of_Servitude_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Portrait_Mask_of_Servitude_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Servitude_(The_Blushing_Mermaid)\" title=\"Mask of Servitude (The Blushing Mermaid)\">Mask of Servitude</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Terror_(The_Blushing_Mermaid)\" title=\"Mask of Terror (The Blushing Mermaid)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Portrait_Mask_of_Terror_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Terror_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Portrait_Mask_of_Terror_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/38px-Portrait_Mask_of_Terror_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Portrait_Mask_of_Terror_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/50px-Portrait_Mask_of_Terror_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mask of Terror\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Portrait_Mask_of_Terror_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png/25px-Portrait_Mask_of_Terror_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b4/Portrait_Mask_of_Terror_%28The_Blushing_Mermaid%29.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Terror_(The_Blushing_Mermaid)\" title=\"Mask of Terror (The Blushing Mermaid)\">Mask of Terror</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quenora_Grisly\" title=\"Quenora Grisly\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png/25px-Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png/38px-Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png/50px-Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Captain Grisly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png/25px-Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Quenora_Grisly\" title=\"Quenora Grisly\">Captain Grisly</a>, the thralls located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Blushing_Mermaid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Blushing Mermaid\">Blushing Mermaid</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Removing a Whispering Mask from an unconscious hag victim kills them if the hag is still alive.</li>\n<li>While <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/38px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/50px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Auntie Ethel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png/25px-Portrait_Ethel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Portrait_Ethel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Auntie_Ethel\" title=\"Auntie Ethel\">Auntie Ethel</a> is alive, the wearer of this mask must make a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> every turn. If failed, they become a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hag%27s_Pawn_(Condition)\" title=\"Hag's Pawn (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hag's Pawn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0d/Hag%27s_Pawn_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hag%27s_Pawn_(Condition)\" title=\"Hag's Pawn (Condition)\">Hag's Pawn</a> (controlled by Auntie Ethel) and attack the party; if all party members equip the masks and become Hag's Pawns, a <a href=\"/wiki/Game_Over_screens\" title=\"Game Over screens\">Game Over</a> screen appears. If all unaffected party members run away from combat (e.g., back to the Tea House), leaving no one to attack, the remaining mask-affected party member can unequip the mask after making a Wisdom saving throw.</li>\n<li>The negative effects of this mask can be prevented by casting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good\" title=\"Protection from Evil and Good\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp/20px-Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp/30px-Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp/40px-Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Protection from Evil and Good\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp/20px-Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Protection_from_Evil_and_Good\" title=\"Protection from Evil and Good\">Protection from Evil and Good</a> before equipping it. In this case, the poison gas clouds in Ethel's lair temporarily dissipate for the wearer, and the thralls wearing these masks (e.g. Mask of Vengeance) will not attack the wearer.\n<ul><li>While in this protected state, the wearer still rolls saving throws against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ephemeral_Whispers_(Condition)\" title=\"Ephemeral Whispers (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ephemeral Whispers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Ephemeral_Whispers_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ephemeral_Whispers_(Condition)\" title=\"Ephemeral Whispers (Condition)\">Ephemeral Whispers</a>, but failing them has no effect.</li></ul></li>\n<li>If Auntie Ethel is dead, the mask can be worn with no ill effects.</li>\n<li>If equipped by a <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">Paladin</a> when inside the tunnel, a dialogue with Ethel starts where a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/30px-D20.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/40px-D20.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"DC&nbsp;15 Charisma Check\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/D20.png/20px-D20.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/D20.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> DC&nbsp;15 <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability check\">Check</a> is needed to prevent succumbing to the mask. Succeeding grants the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Voice_of_Reason_(Condition)\" title=\"Voice of Reason (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Voice of Reason\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Voice_Of_Reason_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Voice_of_Reason_(Condition)\" title=\"Voice of Reason (Condition)\">Voice of Reason</a> condition.</li>\n<li>Succumbing to Auntie Ethel's will due to wearing a Whispering Mask is an <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin#Oaths_and_Oathbreaking\" title=\"Paladin\">oathbreaking action</a> for <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_Devotion\" title=\"Oath of Devotion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Class_Paladin_Devotion_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Paladin_Devotion_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Class_Paladin_Devotion_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Paladin_Devotion_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Class_Paladin_Devotion_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Paladin_Devotion_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paladins of Devotion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Class_Paladin_Devotion_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Paladin_Devotion_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Class_Paladin_Devotion_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_Devotion\" title=\"Oath of Devotion\">Paladins of Devotion</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_the_Ancients\" title=\"Oath of the Ancients\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Class_Paladin_Ancients_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Paladin_Ancients_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Class_Paladin_Ancients_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Paladin_Ancients_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Class_Paladin_Ancients_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Paladin_Ancients_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paladins of the Ancients\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Class_Paladin_Ancients_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Paladin_Ancients_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Class_Paladin_Ancients_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_the_Ancients\" title=\"Oath of the Ancients\">Paladins of the Ancients</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_Vengeance\" title=\"Oath of Vengeance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Class_Paladin_Vengeance_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Paladin_Vengeance_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Class_Paladin_Vengeance_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Paladin_Vengeance_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/81/Class_Paladin_Vengeance_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Paladin_Vengeance_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paladins of Vengeance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/81/Class_Paladin_Vengeance_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Paladin_Vengeance_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/81/Class_Paladin_Vengeance_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oath_of_Vengeance\" title=\"Oath of Vengeance\">Paladins of Vengeance</a>.</li></ul>\n\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195227\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.128 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.137 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6594/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 97077/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 35448/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 9/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.035/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1392156/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  113.960      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%  113.960      1 -total\n 35.42%   40.368     24 Template:Icon_text\n 28.59%   32.576     54 Template:Trim\n 26.70%   30.425     16 Template:Icon_link\n 15.88%   18.099      9 Template:CharLink\n 14.16%   16.140     25 Template:Ifempty\n 12.67%   14.443      3 Template:SmCond\n 12.11%   13.803      4 Template:Uid\n  8.22%    9.373     24 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3950-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195227 and revision id 379310. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}